    (tstamp 035de549-34c6-4617-9ecc-cf1e334e0dc8)
    (at 80.15 29.15)
    (descr "Kailh PG1316S (CPG1316S01D02) for hand soldering: the four frame anchors are SMD pads (hotplate), the two switch contacts sit on plated half-holes at the front edge of a window in the board and are soldered from below with an iron. Window/half-hole idea after Mike Holscher's mikecinq; drawn independently from the Kailh land pattern. Order with castellated holes.")
